## Quick Start

```bash
go mod tidy
go build -o bin/{{ .BinaryName }} ./main.go
./bin/{{ .BinaryName }} version
```

## Commands

- `version`: print build and version info
{{- if not .Minimal }}
- `greet --name World`: sample command for Cobra usage
- `mcp`: start MCP stdio server with a sample `hello` tool

## MCP Layering

- `cmd/mcp.go`: thin CLI entry, delegates to internal package
- `internal/mcp/server.go`: builds and starts MCP stdio server
- `internal/mcp/handler/*`: tool registration + request parsing
- `internal/mcp/service/*`: business logic called by handlers
{{- end }}

## Included Utilities

- `pkg/log`: zap logger wrapper with stdio/stderr/file output
- `utils/time_util`: shared timestamp layout constants
- `utils/retry`: retry helpers with exponential backoff + jitter
- `utils/http_util`: HTTP client wrapper with retry and JSON helpers
- `utils/file_util`: common file helpers (exists/copy/json read-write)

